  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Cover a 30 cm foam or wire wreath base with a plain green dc tube. Then attach "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "flower-motif-wr"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "flower motifs"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "leaf-motif-wr"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "leaf motifs"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " in clusters around the front."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Make around 12 flowers in pink, white, and yellow, and 20 leaves in two greens. Attach with the tapestry needle. Total yarn around 180 m across all colours."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "suppliesCard",
        "attrs": {
          "heading": "Materials",
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "DK yarn, green (base cover)",
              "qty": "80 m"
            },
            {
              "name": "DK yarn, flower colours (3 colours)",
              "qty": "20 m each"
            },
            {
              "name": "DK yarn, leaf greens (2 colours)",
              "qty": "20 m each"
            },
            {
              "name": "4 mm crochet hook",
              "qty": "1"
            },
            {
              "name": "Tapestry needle",
              "qty": "1"
            },
            {
              "name": "Scissors",
              "qty": "1 pair"
            },
            {
              "name": "30 cm wreath base",
              "qty": "1"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Base cover"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Crochet a dc rectangle long enough to cover the wreath circumference. Seam into a tube. Slide over wreath base and join ends."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Flower motif (make 12)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 1: ch 4, sl st to ring, 12 dc in ring. Round 2: * ch 2, 5 tr in ring sp, ch 2, sl st in next dc; rep 5 more times. 6 petals. Fasten off."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Leaf motif (make 20)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Ch 8. Work along spine: sl st, dc, htr, 3 tr in tip, htr, dc, sl st. Fasten off."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Assembly"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Arrange flowers and leaves in 3 to 4 clusters around the base. Sew each motif securely with the tapestry needle. Add a ribbon loop at the top for hanging."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What to try next"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The advent wreath cover uses the same wreath-covering method for a seasonal variant."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}